    "sketch.ino": "void setup() {\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n  DDRD &= ~(1 << 4); // Safely configure Pin 4 as INPUT\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  // Check if Bit 4 of PIND is a 1\n  if (PIND & (1 << 4)) {\n    Serial.println(\"Pin 4 is HIGH\");\n  }\n  delay(100);\n}\n"
